SUMMARY:Name That Tune (The Very Best of 7 Decades) (November 28th)  
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Come join us for a fun day of **Name That Tune** as we travel through seve
 n decades of unforgettable songs!\n\nFrom old favourites and classic hits 
 to songs you may not have heard in years\, we’ll put our musical memorie
 s to the test while enjoying a relaxed day of laughs\, drinks\, food and g
 ood company.\n\n\\*Please note that we are at The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub a
 t 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence and south of the 40
 1). We are in the back dining area—come find us!\n\n\\*Joined by my othe
 r groups too :)\n\nEvent details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n
 (Organizer/Host)\n──────────────\nEvent detail
 s\n**Name That Tune – The Very Best of 7 Decades!**\n\\*You will be in g
 roups of 4 to 6 people (working as a team)\n• Music spanning seven decad
 es\n• Classic hits and memorable favourites from different eras\n• Mee
 t new people and reconnect with familiar faces\n────────
 ──────\nFriendly reminders\nEvent fee: $10 per person for rese
 rved seating and event organization.\nFood and drinks are purchased separa
 tely.\nPay the event fee in cash at the event or by e-transfer in advance 
 to:\n[steveflemming11@gmail.com](mailto:steveflemming11@gmail.com)\n\\*Gre
 at dinner menu and food specials provided\n\\*One beverage or appetizer mi
 nimum upon arrival to support the venue\n───────────
 ───\nParking and transportation\n\\*Lots of street parking on Avenue
  Road and free residential parking\nThe Pheasant: A Firkin Pub:\n[https://
 www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/](https://www.firkinpubs.com/theph
 easantandfirkin/)\n\\*15–20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway sta
 tion—or simply take the bus or an Uber from the station.
