 sic!
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nGood day everyone\,\
 n\nJoin us for a relaxed and friendly Saturday night dinner party where yo
 u can meet new people\, catch up with familiar faces and enjoy an evening 
 of conversation\, laughter and classic 80s and 90s music.\n\n\\*Joined by 
 my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out with
  lots of friendly peers to begin our weekend with!\n\n\\*Please note we ar
 e at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks 
 north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we are in the back dining area to 
 find us)**\n\n*\\*You can also ask the wait staff or bartender if you like
  to show you to the group (simply ask for Steve's games event)*\n\n**-Free
  Parking found on residential side streets**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nS
 incerely\,\n\nDJ Steve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent Details:\n**Th
 e Mix and Mingle Saturday Night Dinner Party!**\n\nCome on your own or bri
 ng a friend. We'll enjoy dinner together\, mingle throughout the evening a
 nd let some great music from two unforgettable decades add to the atmosphe
 re.\n\n• **Mix and mingle** with a friendly group in a relaxed social se
 tting\n• **Enjoy dinner and conversation** while getting to know some ne
 w people\n• **Listen to great 80s and 90s music** throughout the evening
 \n• **Come on your own or bring a friend** — everyone is welcome to jo
 in the fun\n\n**Event Fee: $10**\nPayment can be made **in cash at the eve
 nt** or **in advance by e-transfer to [SteveFlemming11@gmail.com](mailto:S
 teveFlemming11@gmail.com)**.\nIf paying by e-transfer\, please include **y
 our name** in the message so your payment can be easily identified.\nCome 
 hungry\, bring your sense of fun and join us for a Saturday night of food\
 , music and good company!\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time a
 fter 6:30 for dinner and mingling\n\\*No extra fee for the 80s and 90s par
 ty after dinner\n\n\\*Great dinner menu and food specials provided:\n(One 
 beverage or appetizer minimum upon arrival to support venue)\n\n**Parking 
 and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street parking on avenue and free reside
 ntial parking\nhttps://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/\n\n(15-20 
 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus or ube
 r from the station)
