 e greatest music of the 80s\, 90s\, early 2000s and your requests too!\n\n
 Join us for a energy filled Saturday night at The Pheasant filled with gre
 at music\, food/drink specials\, dancing\, laughs and a super fun crowd.\n
 \n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulou
 s turn out with lots of friendly peers to begin our weekend with!\n\n\\*Pl
 ease note we are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (ro
 ughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we are in the back 
 dining area to find us)**\n\n*\\*You can also ask the wait staff or barten
 der if you like to show you to the group (simply ask for Steve's games eve
 nt)*\n\n**-Free Parking found on residential side streets**\n\n(Event Deta
 ils Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nDJ Steve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent
  Details:\n**The Ultimate 80s\, 90s and Early 2000s Saturday Night Dance a
 nd Party!**\n\nDJ Steve Flemming will be playing a great mix of familiar f
 avourites from two unforgettable decades.\n\n• Dance to 80s and 90s favo
 urites with songs that bring back some great memories\n• Enjoy a fun par
 ty atmosphere with disco lights\, music and plenty of room to dance\n• M
 ix and mingle with new people and familiar faces throughout the evening\n
 • Come on your own or bring a friend — just arrive ready for a fun Sat
 urday night!\n\n**Event Fee: $10**\nPayment can be made **in cash at the e
