 me join us\, hit the dance floor and enjoy a Saturday night filled with mu
 sic\, memories and good company!\n\n***\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arr
 ive anytime between 8:00 pm and 10:00 pm (if you can)\n(arrive earlier if 
