SUMMARY:Steve Flemming Presents: Love Will Find a Way! (Group Dating Game)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Please join us for a fun\, interactive and laughter filled "group dating g
 ame" experience. We all bring years of knowledge\, wisdom and stories\; so
  together we can support\, inspire and share optimal understanding to love
 \, dating and fulfilling relationships.\n\nThis will be a well organized\,
  interactive and valuable afternoon as we dive deeper into the real meanin
 gs of love\, romance\, intimacy and effective dating.\n\nWe will be joined
  by my other social groups too so we can anticipate a great afternoon\n\nE
 vent details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━\nEvent Details\n**Steve Flemming Presents:**\n**Love Will Fin
 d a Way!**\n**(Group Dating Game)**\n\n* An inspiring\, interactive and we
 lcoming afternoon as we go deeper into the universal topic of love\, datin
 g and intimate relationships\n* Let's not take ourselves too seriously eit
 her (we're all in this together—so we'll definitely share some laughs to
 o :)\n* Invite your friends or come on your own\; all are welcome!\n* Stic
 k around after for our dinner party event too (optional—no extra fee to 
 join that event)\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━\nAbout the Organizer/Host\nSteve Flemming p
 rovides over 20 years of producing community events and group facilitation
  on personal growth\, spirituality and relationships. He looks forward to 
 involving everyone in a safe\, fun and inspirational way. We will be sure 
 to experience a wonderful afternoon with great\, thoughtful people in an i
 deal setting for connection and conversation.\n━━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n**Where to Meet
  Us**\nDate: Sunday\, November 29th\, 2026\nTime: 2:00 pm\nLocation: The P
 heasant — A Firkin Pub\nAddress: 1999 Avenue Road\, Toronto\nMeeting are
 a: Back dining area\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━\n**Event Fee and Payment**\nEvent fee: $
 10 upon arrival\, HST included\nPayment: Cash or e-transfer when you arriv
 e\nE-transfer: [steveflemming11@gmail.com](mailto:steveflemming11@gmail.co
 m)\nParking: Free parking in the residential area around the venue\n━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━━\nFood and Beverages\n\n* Dinner and beverage menu available too\n* 
 Includes reserved seating for the group\n* Beverage and/or appetizer minim
 um to support the staff and venue\n\nRemember to tip the hard-working serv
 ers too. Thank you for your co-operation :)
