SUMMARY:Friday Night Dinner and Dance with Retro Crush – ’80s Tribute 
 Band! (Dec. 4th)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Get ready for a fun Friday night of dinner\, mingling\, dancing\, live ’
 80s music and great company at Smoke Show!\n\n**Please ask for Steve when 
 you arrive** so the staff can point you to me and the group. If you’re p
 aying cash\, please give your event fee directly to me once you join us. M
 uch appreciated!\n\n**Date** — Friday\, December 4\, 2026\n**Arrival tim
 e** — Please join us between 6:30 p.m. and 8:30 p.m. (if you can)\n**Loc
 ation** — Smoke Show\n**Address** — 744 Mount Pleasant Road\, Toronto\
 n**Free parking** — Look for free street parking in the nearby residenti
 al area\, along Eglinton\, and on Mount Pleasant north of Eglinton\, where
  signs permit.\n**Transit** — Smoke Show is a short walk from Mount Plea
 sant Station at Eglinton and Mount Pleasant.\n\n**Members of my other soci
 al groups will be joining us too\, so we can look forward to a great turno
 ut!**\n\nDetails below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)
 \n\n**Event details**\n**Friday Night Dinner and Dance with Retro Crush 
 – ’80s Tribute Band!**\n\nWe’ll start the evening over dinner and co
 nversation\, then hit the dance floor as Retro Crush brings the ’80s to 
 life. Come on your own or bring a friend. It’s a relaxed\, social night 
 where singles\, couples and friends can meet\, talk\, laugh and enjoy the 
 music together.\n\n💃 Plenty of dancing\n🎸 Live music with Retro Crus
 h\, an ’80s tribute band\n🎶 ’80s favourites from pop\, rock and new
  wave\n🍽️ Dinner\, appetizers and drinks available for purchase\n🗣
 ️ Time to mix\, mingle and get to know the group over dinner\n😊 A fri
 endly\, welcoming atmosphere\n👋 Come solo or bring some friends\nNo nee
 d to be a great dancer. Just come ready to have some fun!\n\n**Arrival tim
 e:**\nJoin us at **6:30 p.m.** for dinner and a chance to get to know each
  other before the live music and dancing. (Arrive between 6:30 pm and 8:30
  pm)\n\n**Event fee:**\n**$10\, HST included.** Please pay me in cash at t
 he event or send an e-transfer in advance to **[steveflemming11@gmail.com]
 (mailto:steveflemming11@gmail.com)**.\n**Friendly reminder**\nPlease order
  at least one beverage or appetizer to support the venue. It’s greatly a
 ppreciated!
