SUMMARY:The Holiday Season Harbourfront Nature Walk! (December 5th)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 **\\*\\*Kindly Read Carefully\\*\\***\n\nPlease join me and my other group
 s as we embrace the Holiday Season with an enjoyable walk through the Harb
 ourfront and beyond. A wonderful day to see the sites\, meet lots of frien
 dly people\, grab a coffee and go for a leisure walk together.\n\n\\*The w
 alking portion will be roughly 2.5 hours with rest periods/bathroom breaks
 \, then we will find a casual place to chill and eat after.\n\n\\*Arrive e
 arly if you like (however we will meet out front at\n2:00 p.m. (we will wa
